{"ok":true,"module":"io/output/d14","docs":{"io/output/d14/binding_port":{"type":"UInt16","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d14.binding_port.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d14.binding_port.help","enum_set":"flowio_binding_port_digital_output","label":"Port physique D14","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d14.binding_port.label","help":"Identifiant du port physique piloté par la sortie D14. Utiliser \"Non connecté\" pour laisser cette sortie logique non affectée.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d14.binding_port.help"},"io/output/d14/d14_active_high":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d14.d14_active_high.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d14.d14_active_high.help","label":"Actif à 1 D14","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d14.d14_active_high.label","help":"Si vrai, D14 est active à l'état haut; sinon active-bas.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d14.d14_active_high.help"},"io/output/d14/d14_initial_on":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d14.d14_initial_on.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d14.d14_initial_on.help","label":"État initial ON D14","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d14.d14_initial_on.label","help":"État appliqué au démarrage pour la sortie D14.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d14.d14_initial_on.help"},"io/output/d14/d14_momentary":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d14.d14_momentary.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d14.d14_momentary.help","label":"Mode impulsion D14","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d14.d14_momentary.label","help":"Active un fonctionnement impulsionnel pour D14.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d14.d14_momentary.help"},"io/output/d14/d14_name":{"type":"CharArray","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d14.d14_name.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d14.d14_name.help","label":"Nom sortie D14","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d14.d14_name.label","help":"Nom lisible de la sortie digitale D14.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d14.d14_name.help"},"io/output/d14/d14_pulse_ms":{"type":"Int32","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d14.d14_pulse_ms.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d14.d14_pulse_ms.help","unit":"ms","label":"Durée impulsion D14 (ms)","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d14.d14_pulse_ms.label","help":"Durée de l'impulsion automatique de D14.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d14.d14_pulse_ms.help"},"io/output/d14/retain_on_warm_reboot":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d14.retain_on_warm_reboot.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d14.retain_on_warm_reboot.help","enum_set":"io_output_boot_behavior","label":"Comportement au reboot D14","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d14.retain_on_warm_reboot.label","help":"Choisit si D14 applique son état initial au démarrage ou tente de conserver le latch matériel lors d'un reboot chaud. Sur MCP23017, la conservation est ignorée et l'état initial est appliqué.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d14.retain_on_warm_reboot.help"}},"meta":{}}